==Route 120==
[[File:Hoenn Route 120 RS.png|thumb|Route 120]]
[[File:Scorched Slab interior RS.png|thumb|Scorched Slab]]

{{rt|120|Hoenn}} is a lengthy path that runs southeastward from [[Fortree City]] to {{rt|121|Hoenn}}. The path meanders past several small ponds and lush vegetation, where Pokémon that can camouflage themselves tend to hide. A small cave named [[Scorched Slab]] and a mysterious set of ruins called the [[Ancient Tomb]] are both located here.

