===Berry Master's house===
====Berry Master====
An elderly man known as the [[Berry Master]] lives with his wife in the house on the west side. Speak to him every day to receive two rare Berries. Possible varieties include [[Pomeg Berry|Pomeg]], [[Kelpsy Berry|Kelpsy]], [[Qualot Berry|Qualot]], [[Hondew Berry|Hondew]], [[Grepa Berry|Grepa]], [[Tamato Berry|Tamato]], [[Cornn Berry|Cornn]], [[Magost Berry|Magost]], [[Rabuta Berry|Rabuta]], and [[Nomel Berry|Nomel]]. The type of Berry received is determined randomly.

====Berry Master's wife====
Speak to the {{DL|Hoenn Route 123|Berry Master's wife}} each day, and she asks if you have heard a good saying lately. Use the [[easy chat system]] to tell her a two-word phrase, and she rewards you with a Berry. Possible varieties include [[Cheri Berry|Cheri]], [[Chesto Berry|Chesto]], [[Pecha Berry|Pecha]], [[Rawst Berry|Rawst]], [[Aspear Berry|Aspear]], [[Leppa Berry|Leppa]], [[Oran Berry|Oran]], [[Persim Berry|Persim]], [[Lum Berry|Lum]], and [[Sitrus Berry|Sitrus]].

There are also five special phrases that each result in a rare variety of Berry. However, four of these phrases each involve an unlockable word, and cannot be used until certain requirements are met. Each phrase may only be used once this way; any further subsequent use results in a random, common variety from the previous list.

